            "review_title": "Review at Sea Breeze Restaurant",
            "review_text": "David Skovborg\n30 contributions\n0\nWe must hope it gets better tomorrow\nJan 2025 • Couples\nFirst day at the resort Hon Tam, where they unfortunately only have their own two restaurants, one of them is Sea Breeze.\nArrived for dinner, got a table and handed out our menu card. And then the time went otherwise, 40min we waited for us to submit our order. My wife even had eye contact with one of the servants several times, but she completely ignored us, she even passed by and looked at us, after which another servant came scratching when she saw that she did not dare take our order.\nWell, then for the meal, we ordered a snack for sharing and two main dishes. My main dish came first and after another 10 minutes my wife’s main dish came along with the fork.\nYou should think they were busy, but there were probably 4 others in the restaurant, divided by two tables. She who ignored us had no problem accepting orders from another table. Unacceptable behavior in my opinion.\nAnd then they have screwed the prices completely, they know that they are the only ones you can eat out here.\nRead more\nTranslated from Danish\nShow original\nWritten January 9, 2025",
