            "review_text": "Nick C\nNewtown, Australia3 contributions\n0\nDon’t bother\nJul 2024 • Family\nStayed on the island for 6 nights. The breakfast was good. The a la carte menu was mostly miss than hit. Good fried rice and water spinach. Terrible burger, ginger chicken was mostly knuckles and ribs. Can’t make a sandwich to save themselves. Don’t bother dining here. Go to the mainland.\nWritten July 6, 2024",
