            "review_title": "Review at Sea Breeze Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Matteo\n12 contributions\n0\nLovely experience\nJan 2020 • Solo\nI was guest at MerePerle Resort for one week and have chance to dine at this cosy restaurant just in front the beach and wonderful scenery above the arcipelago of Nha Trang. The atmosphere is unique, cuisine is well made from international to Vietnamese must-eat. The service was very well kind and cared, very active. I would like to mention the attitude of Mr. Quoc, Ms. Han and Ms. Hong as well as all the staff of the restaurant for their lovely assistance, food tips and so forth during my stay on the island.\n\nDefinitely a lovely food experience into the island vacation overall!\nRead more\nWritten January 5, 2020",
