            "review_text": "Melissa\n6 contributions\n0\nPeace and nice place to enjoy the food\nDec 2019 • Couples\nHad our fist meal after arriving at the island. Fried rice are always good. Chicken Curry is full of taste of coconut. I personally like it a lot! Spring roll was crispy and good too.Comparing with the busy part of island where is full of daily trip tourists, it’s a peace part of the island. Enjoyed the food a lot, staffs are very friendly, love the smiles from them. Cocktails(white/black Russian) are good!\nRead more\nWritten December 11, 2019",
